  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kiribati Ports Infrastructure Investment Program - Kiribati - Transport</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The AIFFP is supporting the Kiribati Port Authority with a series of activities to enhance Kiribati&#x2019;s maritime sector security and capacity. A key activity is the preparation of a Masterplan for the future redevelopment of Betio Port. Outputs include a Betio Port Infrastructure Masterplan and a prioritised infrastructure investment plan for a capacity upgrade of this congested international Port. Additional activities include a condition assessment and design of repair works to rehabilitate the Charlie Wharf, and preliminary investigations into scoping an upgrade of the Kanton Wharf, on the Kanton atoll. AIFFP has engaged engineering Consultants, Arup Australia, to develop the Masterplan and prepare the infrastructure investment plan as well as preparation of  a reference design for the proposed Charlie Wharf Repair Project.</narrative>
  </description>
